ily: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">근무상황부 제출&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">근로한 다음달 매월&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">일 각 근로부서에 제출</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">6.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">유의사항</span></strong></strong></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">장학생 사전교육은 별도 소집 없이&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">붙임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">]&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">교육 자료로 대체</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">수업시간 및 해외체류기간에는 출근부 입력 금지</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">재학 중인 경우에만 근로를 할 수 있으므로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">학적이 변동될 경우 근로 불가능</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">부정근로로 적발된 경우 근로 참여 제한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">국가근로 관련</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">]</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ⊙&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">허위근로&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">근로를 하지 않고 출근부를 입력한 경우</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">→&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">장학금 환수 및 확정일로부터 해당학기를 포함하여&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">개 학기 근로 참여 제한</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><spa